asOQ&oe=69A19962"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QcE4vAXF8rIQ7kNvwHaHIMF&_nc_oc=AdnPl8RaXeuPg7fR07lNmzG9segRDiodOvNRrGLfOlhQ4H5S1zxYewlTZMaumFh2qqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsCpgVf0amcrPENoLXFZPXI4K4C1HLMLr9wuCCg3xSu0w&oe=69A18373"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1_uWU0R5MAEQ7kNvwH0fBGF&_nc_oc=AdlUr64IqL_M1mk5vKnYtxsTUuqEQZ9rYVICAkb9OOUoE0_7EOWzhWwzwA0bL45dvDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsHwGlGH0RsgxYviDxjBfH_uPJM-TrRN_00P0Gh_1rLGA&oe=69A1826F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3oaXKUFYhnoQ7kNvwHXWZnq&_nc_oc=Adkj8yOeYlwLtG6dVFL2Jux7g9PbOraCfdD9prKjKcrv9CUk1d-N7hug1V-EAd_NWvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvmpYkONWqIlkfS6mx8wTZlsC9uKqTDd6-61l3A_aYlZw&oe=69A17E65"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qPgpUoXR6-gQ7kNvwHMfUiW&_nc_oc=AdkOSQhgXEjx6_vv0cdU_Mrk4vSQFO6lx2uyGM4QmtM-wpicX4Ho5w8JxXdRLbBw3UM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afui-rxG_xWaTIG9_9DGZGO0sJGTLqx9gdQ3tG1XuqnLIg&oe=69A17D4D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jFxLD1qPFY4Q7kNvwERP-Xy&_nc_oc=Adn0s272e89U66K2c8UFFaHSTD2QMejlBinJxAh-6OYrBj2kunfvCMBQBDaJY3qnx68&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsBBsLAGl2ZTw0K39CUUF5eAaeOYfZUafLMhpw5fTj5YQ&oe=69A188A9"}, {"file_name": "38982645_1000853181732648_5055517427829171192_n.png", "id": "1043990680394008", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031625_1043990683727341_3557431131423146005_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B445TmBWlQgQ7kNvwFG39Me&_nc_oc=Adl-Y6LLsR0CtPHdS-kDtoChIXgQMUWQ1ncJyQmUFAgZ4iVoWal-ePItLkyCMhNevjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2